{"purpose":"Define product requirement for 'anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e' — deploy langsung dari local ke single VPS/bare-metal via SSH dengan full lifecycle Anvil (build→verify→install→activate→rollback) tanpa CI, sebagai CI-agnostic trigger dengan guard per-env.","content":"# REQ local-deploy — Deploy Langsung dari Local\n\n## 1. Users \u0026 Jobs\n- **Solo dev / small team** butuh deploy dari laptop ke VPS tanpa menunggu CI (own VPS, bukan fleet).\n- **Platform team** butuh konsistensi lifecycle + audit tanpa bypass verification.\n\n## 2. Product Requirement\n`anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e [--dry-run] [--json]` membaca `anvil.yaml` (`project.standard` + `server.targets[env]` {host,user,sshKeyPath}) lalu:\n1) Build artifact lokal (manifest.json identity-from-content, checksum sha-256 via internal/artifact.Package)\n2) Verify lokal (spec:artifact-manifest + spec:verification-contract 6-check)\n3) Transport via SSH (scp/rsync) ke server\n4) Remote invoke `anvil server install` + `anvil server activate` via SSH exec — state tetap di server `/.anvil`, verification-before-trust gate sebelum activate, rollback first-class.\n\n## 3. Acceptance Criteria (derived from spike evidence)\n- **AC1 Build+Verify local:** `anvil deploy --dry-run` hanya build+verify tanpa install; output human+JSON konsisten (spike UX RunDryRun, VerifyArtifact, envelope v1).\n- **AC2 Transport idempotent \u0026 aman:** Push 50 artifact via SSH p95 \u003c30s (size ~5-50MB), retry mid-transfer tidak corrupt (atomic tmp+fsync+rename), checksum manifest.json valid (spike SSH histogram.csv, retry.log).\n- **AC3 Full lifecycle remote:** Install→Verify→Activate→`anvil status`→Rollback e2e berhasil, Negotiate capability declaration sebelum install (spike e2e: 9/9 harness PASS, 4 bukti log).\n- **AC4 Race safety:** Concurrent local-vs-CI install serial via OperationLock flock + optimistic concurrency, tidak create duplicate release, no corruption (spike race 8 goroutines, lock.log).\n- **AC5 UX \u0026 error handling:** Network timeout/unreachable → AppError Exit 1 + suggest retry + ssh -v probe; Auth fail → Exit 4 + redact secret; permission denied → actionable; progress push % + verify step; `anvil deploy --help` terdokumentasi (spike UX error_matrix 6 kinds, progress.log, help.txt).\n- **AC6 Security guard:** Dev allow local, staging allow dengan --confirm, prod: CI-only by default, local hanya jika allowlist + confirm prompt + audit binding ke SSH principal (spike race guard_recommendation.md; e2e audit.log, security conditional PASS).\n- **AC7 Observability:** `anvil deploy --json` envelope v1, audit log JSON-lines dengan DeployUser terikat auth, redacted secrets, tidak leak KeyPath/private key (spike UX redaction_check PASS, e2e audit.log).\n\n## 4. Out of Scope\n- Multi-server/fleet, infra provisioning di luar SSH single target, perubahan lifecycle model, implementasi permanen sebelum ADR approved.\n\n## 5. Constraints In Force\n- vis:anvil-manifesto §4 domain ownership, §10 principles; ADR-003 deterministic lifecycle, ADR-006 state, ADR-016 deployment model; spec:artifact-manifest, verification-contract, lifecycle-model, command-contract, compatibility-matrix.\n\n## 6. Evidence to Approve (already produced by spikes, link below)\n- Spike SSH: histogram.csv p50/p95 + checksum_verify.log\n- Spike e2e: e2e.log + verify.log + audit.log + summary.json (artifact1/2, install1/2, negotiate)\n- Spike race: race.log + lock.log + state_before/after + summary.json + guard_recommendation.md\n- Spike UX: dryrun_*.txt/json + error_human_*.txt + error_matrix.md + progress.log + help.txt + summary.json\n\n## 7. Open Item for Architecture\n- Env promotion rule \u0026 auth binding final decision → adr:local-deploy-transport.\n- Concrete CLI contract (flags, exit codes, JSON schema) → spec update minor.\n"}